{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6c1c5153-eb78-4eda-8a52-1fb9babd4d2f",
    "name": "Shellafood API",
    "description": "# Shellafood API\n\nDirect backend requests to `{{backend_url}}`, organized **by app screen** — each folder mirrors a page in the Next.js app and lists the APIs that power its UI sections.\n\n---\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Import `shellafood-environment.json`\n2. Select environment **Shellafood - Backend**\n3. Set `module_id` to the module you are testing (e.g. `6` for restaurants, `3` for hypermarket)\n4. For authenticated endpoints, set `access_token` after login\n\n---\n\n## Screen map\n\n| Screen | Route | APIs in this collection |\n|--------|-------|-------------------------|\n| Home | `/home` | Banners, Modules, Discounted Stores, Recent Orders |\n| Module | `/modules/:id?module_name=…` | Offers, Categories, Stores |\n| Auth | `/auth` | Guest, Send OTP, Verify OTP, Register |\n\n---\n\n## Common headers\n\n| Header | Used by | Example |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `zoneId` | Most endpoints | `[2]` |\n| `moduleId` | Module-scoped data | `6` |\n| `latitude` / `longitude` | Stores, categories, discounted stores | `24.567752` / `46.5444937` |\n| `X-Localization` / `X-localization` | Arabic content | `ar` |\n| `Authorization` | Recent orders | `Bearer {{access_token}}` |\n\n---\n\nSee `postman/README.md` in the repo for the full screen → component → API reference.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54305504",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/54305504-6c1c5153-eb78-4eda-8a52-1fb9babd4d2f?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Home Page",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Banners — Promo carousel",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "description": "Required"
              },
              {
                "key": "zoneId",
                "value": "{{zone_id}}",
                "description": "Delivery zone — default [2]"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{backend_url}}/api/v1/banners?featured=1",
              "host": [
                "{{backend_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "banners"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "featured",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Returns promotional module banners"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Powers the home page banner carousel."
          },
          "response": []
        },
